# Compiled Go tool binaries. Every package under scripts/ is a main package, and
# `go build` writes its output next to wherever it was invoked: ./scripts/<tool>/<tool>
# from the module dir, ./<tool> from the repo root. Both names are listed for every
# tool, because a partial list is how two 10MB binaries reached a pull request.
# scripts/check-tracked-binaries.sh is the backstop.
